  "details": "I recently was in an instance where certain objects failed to sync for me, even after rejoining; the Japanese players in the instance reported no issues. Logs contain messages such as:\n2021.06.08 08:29:16 Error      -  [Network Processing] Could not locate object with path :927D5/omote\nWorld ID is wrld_7f2b50ab-de02-4d2c-b6ba-d1ae0c44a62b. Full logs to be sent via ticket.\nRepro: enter the building and walk through the teleporter in the attached image. Click the sphere on a JP locale client. See if you can pick up the spawned cards as a US locale client.\nI suspect that the heirarchy might contain non-ascii names - or perhaps there's a bug with prefab instantiation with SDK2 worlds.",
